{"version":1,"content":"<p>「比亞迪閃充，我停車一小時收取我三百元佔位費？你們真的窮瘋了是麼？我維權！」一張300元佔位費的賬單截圖，最近在社交媒體上廣泛傳播。按照該車主的説法，他當時在天津某座閃充站充電，27分鐘充了17.74度電，電費28.03元。但充電結束後，車主沒有及時拔槍移車，於是便產生了這筆昂貴的費用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587114.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:28.231681+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:03:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.429245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.429245+00:00","content_hash":"f156cad73874e37053f4bffa7c04b73896edf3357658e8c88ede5fdcc7784aef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}